LOCUS       p15A_ori_pSU38           524 bp    DNA              UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  p15A origin as carried by the pSU vectors (pSU38 family): the 524 bp
            from the RNA II promoter -10 to the RNA-to-DNA transition. The p15A
            fragment of these vectors starts 21 bp into the RNA II promoter, so
            the -35 comes from vector DNA. Otherwise identical to the p15A part,
            except that it lacks the base V00309 flags as a conflict (662)..
ACCESSION   p15A_ori_pSU38
VERSION     p15A_ori_pSU38
